'' A 'ustring * N' into a constructor taking 'byref as wstring' or 'byref as zstring' is fbc's 58,
'' as it was already for an ordinary call -- explicit, 'var', 'new', and an implicit conversion
'' into a parameter of the type. tiko chose the constructor and compiled each.
'' TEST: cli
