'' EXPECT-OUT: fixustr-wide-ctor.tiko(23,12): error TKO0698: this argument does not convert to the parameter's type
'' EXPECT-OUT: fixustr-wide-ctor.tiko(24,25): error TKO0698: this argument does not convert to the parameter's type
'' EXPECT-OUT: fixustr-wide-ctor.tiko(26,17): error TKO0698: this argument does not convert to the parameter's type
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0994
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 5
